1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Open the app.

2
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:02,360
Tap the big green button

3
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:03,880
that says New job.

4
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,180
Use the dropdown menu

5
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,240
to pick what kind

6
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:07,340
of job it was.

7
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:08,380
House clearance,

8
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:09,220
garden, garage,

9
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:10,310
and so on.

10
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,000
This matters.

11
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:12,700
The type you pick

12
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,560
is what the video

13
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,860
gets filed under,

14
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:15,680
so when customers look

15
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,260
for a garden clearance,

16
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:17,740
yours is the

17
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:18,530
one they find.

18
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,140
Type the town or area

19
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,400
the job was in.

20
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:22,000
That shows on

21
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:22,560
your job list,

22
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:23,100
so you can

23
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:23,320
find it later.

24
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,140
It is not said

25
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:25,900
in the video.

26
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:27,180
Add the postcode if

27
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:27,480
you have it.

28
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:28,620
It goes on the job

29
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,740
record and the transfer note,

30
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,850
never in the video.

31
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,080
Tap Start.

32
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:35,160
Tap the Before box.

33
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,700
You get two choices.

34
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,880
Take photo opens your camera.

35
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,460
Choose from gallery uses a

36
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:41,890
photo you've already taken.

37
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,600
Take the Before first,

38
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,770
with the rubbish in it.

39
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:45,880
Then the After,

40
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,140
standing in the same spot,

41
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,740
with the rubbish gone.

42
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:49,920
Same spot is what

43
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,190
makes the video work.

44
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,969
During photos are optional.

45
00:00:52,969 --> 00:00:53,716
Use them for

46
00:00:53,716 --> 00:00:54,338
a big job,

47
00:00:54,338 --> 00:00:55,395
so people can see

48
00:00:55,395 --> 00:00:56,639
the work in between.

49
00:00:56,789 --> 00:00:58,415
Every photo saves on its

50
00:00:58,415 --> 00:00:59,363
own as you go.

51
00:00:59,363 --> 00:01:00,650
If you lose signal,

52
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:01,531
you only lose

53
00:01:01,531 --> 00:01:02,547
that one photo,

54
00:01:02,547 --> 00:01:03,360
not the job.

55
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,640
Got one wrong?

56
00:01:04,610 --> 00:01:06,040
Tap Retake on that photo

57
00:01:06,010 --> 00:01:07,520
and do it again.

58
00:01:07,490 --> 00:01:08,540
Nothing is shared until

59
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:09,700
you say so.

60
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:10,960
When Before and After

61
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:12,000
are both in,

62
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:13,160
tap Done.

63
00:01:13,130 --> 00:01:14,240
That saves the job.

64
00:01:14,530 --> 00:01:16,600
Nothing has gone anywhere yet.

65
00:01:16,570 --> 00:01:17,480
Next, the voice

66
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:18,709
and the video.
